From: mix2-port <mix2@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: let userspace control the role switch

The Mi MIX 2 has no Type-C port controller driver that could drive the
dwc3 role switch, so expose the "role" attribute and let userspace
(mix2-usb-mode) switch between device mode (USB networking to a computer)
and host mode (hubs, keyboards, mice).
---
 drivers/usb/dwc3/drd.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/drd.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/drd.c
@@ -512,6 +512,7 @@ static int dwc3_setup_role_switch(struct dwc3 *dwc)
 	dwc3_set_mode(dwc, mode);
 
 	dwc3_role_switch.fwnode = dev_fwnode(dwc->dev);
+	dwc3_role_switch.allow_userspace_control = true;
 	dwc3_role_switch.set = dwc3_usb_role_switch_set;
 	dwc3_role_switch.get = dwc3_usb_role_switch_get;
 	dwc3_role_switch.driver_data = dwc;
